`s 2025(c)(7)(A) the State may seek administrative and judicial review of the action under section 2023` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the Secretary asserts a financial claim against, or establishes a liability amount with respect to, a State agency under paragraph (1)` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "if the Secretary asserts a financial claim against or establishes a liability amount with respect to a State agency under paragraph (1)"; subparagraphs (B) and (C) are the exceptions
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2017 | With respect to any fiscal year, a determination of the payment error rate of a State agency or a determination whether the payment error rate exceeds 105 percent of the national performance measure for payment error rates shall be subject to administrative or judicial review only if the Secretary establishes a liability amount with respect to the fiscal year under paragraph (1)(C).
@ref s 2025(c)(7)(B) determination of payment error rate (src:2017)
GIVEN `the determination is of the payment error rate of a State agency, or whether it exceeds 105 percent of the national performance measure` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Secretary establishes a liability amount with respect to the fiscal year under paragraph (1)(C)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(c)(7)(B) the determination is subject to administrative or judicial review` MEANS
