        IF (NOT `the determination is of the payment error rate of a State agency, or whether it exceeds 105 percent of the national performance measure`) THEN NOTHING
        IF `the Secretary establishes a liability amount with respect to the fiscal year under paragraph (1)(C)` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall be subject to administrative or judicial review only if the Secretary establishes a liability amount with respect to the fiscal year"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2019 | An action by the Secretary under subparagraph (D) or (F)(iii) of paragraph (1) shall not be subject to administrative or judicial review.
@ref s 2025(c)(7)(C) actions of the Secretary on the liability amount (src:2019)
GIVEN `the action is an action by the Secretary under subparagraph (D) or (F)(iii) of paragraph (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(c)(7)(C) the action is subject to administrative or judicial review` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall not be subject to administrative or judicial review"
        IF `the action is an action by the Secretary under subparagraph (D) or (F)(iii) of paragraph (1)` THEN JUST FALSE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar is on "an action by the Secretary under subparagraph (D) or (F)(iii) of paragraph (1)"
