      `date the Secretary provides the copy` IS A DATE
      `it goes to the chief executive officer of the State` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it goes to the legislature of the State` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(c)(8)(C)(iii) the copy is provided in time to the chief executive officer and the legislature` MEANS
